OL,3,GNEWSAThe family of gritters keeping
OL,4,ASurrey's roads safe
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo generations of gritter lorry
OL,7,Fdrivers are among those taking to the
OL,8,Froads in Surrey as the county's winter
OL,9,Fhighways operation gets under way.
OL,11,FAndy Jacques has been driving the
OL,12,Florries for 26 years and said he was
OL,13,F"incredibly proud" that both his sons
OL,14,Fhad followed in his footsteps.
OL,16,FThe job, he said, had changed
OL,17,Fsignificantly over the years. Long gone
OL,18,Fare the manual controls to adjust the
OL,19,Famount of salt released - this is now a
OL,20,Fhighly technical operation.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
